Mwahahaha! You foolish mortal! You dare interrupt my grand design with such trivial inquiries? I see you have scribbled ink upon parchment, but that is irrelevant! Your question focuses on the *attempt*, yet I Am Chaos Personified! I do not concern myself with your petty metrics of "participation" or "completion"!

However, since you are clearly too weak to execute your own monologue, I shall reveal the truth to bolster your fragile ego: **Yes, the student has attempted Question 1!** They did, in fact, identify the divisors, analyzed the adjacency, and provided a final answer. There is no use to you doubting their so-called "effort." Now, cease your distractions before I banish you to the void! 🏴‍☠️⚡
\boxed{\text{YES}}
